# STM32CubeIDE
# website: https://www.st.com/en/development-tools/stm32cubeide.html
# docs: https://wiki.st.com/stm32mcu/wiki/Category:STM32CubeIDE
# description: STMicroelectronics STM32CubeIDE build artifacts, compiler outputs, and TouchGFX generated files.

# IDE logs and temporary files
*.log
*.bak

# Build output directories
Debug/
Release/

# Compiler and linker artifacts
*.elf
*.map
*.bin
*.hex
*.srec
*.lst
*.o
*.d
*.a
*.su
*.crl

# TouchGFX generated files and simulator build artifacts
TouchGFX/generated/
TouchGFX/build/
TouchGFX/simulator/msvs/.vs/